	# LOLCODE frontend skeleton (feature-esoteric-lolcode, esoteric probe): HAI/KTHXBYE,
	# I HAS A/ITZ, VISIBLE, R assign, prefix ops (SUM OF..), BOTH SAEM/DIFFRINT + O RLY?,
