	# utimensat/futimens -- the last crtl gap between the busybox userland and
	# `touch', and the reason its applet set was 79 rather than 80.
	# ROW 2 IS THE ONE WITH A WRONG ANSWER AVAILABLE. UTIME_OMIT is not a time,
